# Pairs of frames for the cost of a forest of spruce A (reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/tree-cost.md): spruce
# A alone on the top of the rock hill east of the meadow (LONE of scripts/content/fir_set.py, ground 63.8 m), seen
# from the west at the height of the middle of its crown, from 24, 48, 97, 194 and 388 m: 18 m tall, it is about
# 800, 400, 200, 100 and 50 px high at 2560x1440 (vertical field of view 67.5 degrees). The hill hides the forest
# behind it. Run once per set of `fir_set.py forest` (the full spruce or thinned ones; the lone spruce is thinned
# with its set) and put the halves side by side; two runs of one set give the noise of the wind and of TAA.
# Stills at noon, each in the calm after a gust; the hero waits on the meadow west of the hill.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh tree-cost /absolute/out
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0

goto pos 43700 3000 500
clear 3000
streaming wait
cam at 46100 7283 500 48500 7283 500
grass wait
wait 4000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lone-024
wait 200

cam at 43700 7283 500 48500 7283 500
wait 2500
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lone-048
wait 200

cam at 38800 7283 500 48500 7283 500
wait 2500
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lone-097
wait 200

cam at 29100 7283 500 48500 7283 500
wait 2500
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lone-194
wait 200

cam at 9700 7283 500 48500 7283 500
wait 2500
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lone-388
wait 200
